{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西環發生火警。今日（22日）下午約3時42分，警方接報指，山道59號昌運大廈地下冒出濃煙，懷疑失火。</p><p>消防到場動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊，迅速將火救熄。意外中無人受傷，毋須疏散；初步懷疑電掣短路起火，波及雜物。據了解，起火位置為大廈地下一間沒有營運的「吉舖」。</p><figure><img alt=\"西環山道63號富山苑及昌運大廈之間的一條後巷冒出濃煙。（Threads@alfred.3cat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201210479771389952716290.png/HiOC7c2adlmZF2acCZDbCASdj4nDEugPsf86QbH_OkE\"/><figcaption>西環山道63號富山苑及昌運大廈之間的一條後巷冒出濃煙。（Threads@alfred.3cat）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:43:50.212052+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:39:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T22:17:51.819543+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:37:29.115911+00:00","content_hash":"d8214c674ff691974c45e338f94e2a0b6a25e47e4e021b9d6eefbfce745f7b03","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}